    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, im prepping for a meeting with a new raw material supplier for our factory in munich. we're worried about price swings and stuff like that. can u give me a checklist of standard terms and conditions i should include in a master service agreement to protect us from supply chain volatility?",
      "source": "evaluator"
