      "content": "For your MSA, start with robust pricing mechanisms, such as defining price adjustment triggers tied to specific market indices rather than arbitrary increases. Ensure clear terms regarding force majeure to account for unexpected global disruptions. Additionally, include provisions for minimum order quantities and flexible delivery schedules to manage inventory risk. Finally, emphasize quality control and inspection rights to protect your production integrity regardless of market fluctuations.",
