    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. what about their behavior during the actual delivery phase? sometimes it feels like these companies have these 'hidden quirks' or ways of operating that only show up when things go wrong. how do i account for those types of unpredictable, almost mischievous disruptions that feel like they're coming from inside the organization?",
