      "content": "To address unpredictable internal operational issues, mandate adherence to Service Level Agreements (SLAs) with quantifiable metrics for performance and response times. Include a specific clause requiring transparent communication for *any* deviation from agreed-upon timelines *before* it impacts your production. Furthermore, insist on a \"process mapping\" appendix in the MSA, detailing their standard operational procedure for handling common contingencies, forcing them to formalize their internal behaviors.",
